## Interactive Elements

### Buttons

**Hard rule — every new page that includes action buttons:**

- Primary / create / save / confirm / duplicate → `className="btn-primary px-3 sm:px-4"` (`.primary-btn` is the same).
- Delete / remove / destroy → `className="delete-btn px-3 sm:px-4"` (`.btn-delete` is the same). Never a plain red outline or `variant="destructive"` fill as the final look.
- Do **not** default to `variant="outline"`, plain `Button`, or text-only links for primary page actions.

```tsx
<Button className="btn-primary px-3 sm:px-4">
  <Plus className="h-4 w-4" />
  Add
</Button>

<Button className="delete-btn px-3 sm:px-4">
  <Trash2 className="h-4 w-4" />
  Delete
</Button>
```

- **ALWAYS** include a Lucide icon (`h-4 w-4`) on `btn-primary` / `primary-btn` and on `delete-btn` — icon + label, never text-only
- **ALWAYS** place action buttons on the **right** (`justify-end` / `ml-auto`) unless the user asks otherwise
- Prefer the same icon+label pattern for outline toolbar actions (Refresh, Convert, etc.)
- Destructive confirms use `.delete-btn`; row overflow menus use `dots.svg` (see Overflow menus below)
- Use consistent spacing: `gap-3` between buttons
- Responsive padding: `px-3 sm:px-4`

### Segmented switches (not boolean Switch)

For a **view switch**, **segmented control**, or multi-option pill toggle (not shadcn on/off `Switch`), use a **sliding white active thumb**:

- Track: `rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-1`
- Active thumb: absolute white pill (`bg-white shadow-sm`) that slides (`transition-transform duration-200`)
- Selected: `text-[#0f5384]`; unselected: `text-slate-500`
- No hover fills on options — selection is thumb + brand color only
- Prefer `SegmentedToggle` from `@/components/ui/segmented-toggle`
- Boolean `Switch` and underline tabs (`StatusUnderlineTabs`) are not covered here

### Input fields

**ALWAYS** give text inputs, selects, textareas, and search fields a visible **0.25px** border. A white, `rgba(255,255,255,…)`, or `slate-200` border disappears on `bg-white` / `bg-slate-50`. Tailwind `border` is 1px — do not use it on fields.

```tsx
<Input className="border-[0.25px] border-slate-300" />
<SelectTrigger className="border-[0.25px] border-slate-300">
<SearchField /> {/* wrapper already has border-[0.25px] border-slate-300; height is h-10 to match selects */}
```

- Width: `border-[0.25px]` (not `border` / 1px)
- Resting color: `border-slate-300` (`#cbd5e1`) — stronger than card `slate-200` so fields read as inputs
- Hover: `hover:border-blue-300`
- Focus: teal `#078FAB` (`focus-visible:border-[#078FAB]`)
- Do **not** use `border-none`, `border-0`, `border` (1px), `border-white/50`, or `border-slate-200` on a standalone field
- `border-0` is allowed **only** on an inner control whose parent already has the visible border (e.g. `SearchField` inner `Input`)
- `.glass-form-control` already includes the 0.25px slate-300 border; do not override it to 1px, white, or transparent
- Search fields in a filter row match adjacent dropdowns at `h-10`

### Search fields

**ALWAYS** use `SearchField` from `@/components/ui/search-field` for search inputs.

```tsx
import { SearchField } from "@/components/ui/search-field";

<SearchField
  value={query}
  onChange={(e) => setQuery(e.target.value)}
  placeholder="Search contracts..."
/>
```

- `.shad-input` sets `px-0 !important` and will hide placeholder text under a Search icon
- If you must compose manually, set `data-with-leading-icon="true"` on the input (padding-left 2.5rem) and do **not** rely on `pl-9` / `pl-10` alone with `shad-input`

### Page index

**ALWAYS** use `PageIndex` from `@/components/ui/page-index` for list pagination. Do not add per-page wrappers.

```tsx
import { PageIndex } from "@/components/ui/page-index";

<PageIndex
  page={page}
  totalItems={total}
  pageSize={20}
  onPageChange={setPage}
  hideWhenSinglePage
  showRange
  itemLabel="contracts"
/>
```

- Pass `totalPages`, or pass `totalItems` + `pageSize` and the component computes the page count
- Plain text Previous / Next with `Page n of n` (no Button chrome, no numbered page buttons)
- Use `scrollToTop` on full-page lists that should jump to the top on page change

### Icons

- **Header icons**: `w-5 h-5 text-[#0f5384]` (placed directly next to title)
- **Button icons**: `h-4 w-4`
- **Stat card icons**: `StatCardIcon` from `@/components/ui/stat-card-icon` (rounded-square mint fill, dark teal icon)
- **Small icons**: `h-3 w-3` or `h-4 w-4`

### Hover Effects

**Cards:**
```tsx
className="hover:bg-blue-50 hover:border-blue-300 transition-all duration-200"
```

**With shadow:**
```tsx
className="shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200"
```

**Group hover:**
```tsx
<div className="group">
  {/* Parent */}
  <div className="group-hover:bg-blue-50">
    {/* Child */}
  </div>
</div>
```

