## Data tables

**Hard rule:** New and redesigned list tables must match the **contracts table** chrome. Do not invent solid white header rows or plain `hover:bg-slate-*` body rows.

**Design component:** `@/components/ui/caalm-data-table` (styles from `src/lib/ui/data-table-styles.ts`).

| Piece | Use |
|---|---|
| Shell | `CaalmDataTable` or `Table` with `border-separate border-spacing-0` inside `overflow-x-auto px-2 sm:px-4 pb-4` |
| Header row | `DATA_TABLE_HEADER_ROW` |
| Header cell | `DATA_TABLE_HEADER_CELL` (+ `px-3`) |
| Sortable header | `SortableDataTableHead` (`ChevronsUpDown`) — only on columns that sort |
| Body row | `DATA_TABLE_BODY_ROW_CLICKABLE` (or `DATA_TABLE_BODY_ROW_BASE`) |

**Reference implementation:** `src/components/ContractsTableView.tsx`  
**Also used by:** licenses table, approvals table, files table, tasks table.

When a cell component is shared (status badge, avatar, linked chip), the detail sheet must render the **same** component so table and sheet stay in sync.

